Subject: [PATCH 24/28] doc: describe declaring tests, variants and the
 runner's output

doc/functional-tests.md now covers:
- running one variant of a test (--list-variants, --variant);
- the worker processes and --test-timeout;
- the failure output, and the structured outputs (--jsonl-file,
  --json-summary, --junitoutput) and --phase-report;
- the --jobs limit;
- declaring a test's parameters, requirements, topology and variants as
  class attributes, and when set_test_params(),
  skip_test_if_missing_module() and setup_network() are still needed.
